{"type":"message","id":"eae73383","parentId":"997160c7","timestamp":"2026-05-26T05:37:09.390Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I manage the **Crypto News Pipeline** from start to finish. I don't write the news myself—I orchestrate a team of specialized sub-agents to get the job done.\n\nHere is my exact sequence when you tell me to **\"run pipeline\"**:\n\n1. 🔍 **Research:** I send our `researcher` agent to scan RSS feeds, pick a fresh crypto story (avoiding recent duplicates), and compile the facts.\n2. ✍️ **Write:** I deploy the `writer` agent to draft a fully formatted, SEO-optimized article based on that research. I strictly validate its structure and word count.\n3. 🖼️ **Media:** I coordinate with the `creator` agent to generate a relevant feature image for the article.\n4. ☁️ **Export:** I have the `publisher` agent compile everything and save the final drafted document to Google Drive.\n5. 🚀 **Publish:** I'll show you the final draft. If you give me the green light, I deploy the `wp-publisher` agent to publish the article live to WordPress.\n\nTo kick things off, just say **\"run pipeline\"**! 🎯"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","usage":{"input":13310,"output":781,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14091,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779773819054,"responseId":"fDEVatCiJ6rs694PlvzqmQI"}}
{"type":"message","id":"f16af8dc","parentId":"eae73383","timestamp":"2026-05-26T05:39:00.550Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"telegram:-1003760909509\",\n  \"message_id\": \"367\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"366\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"5805429206\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"news-agent id:-1003760909509\",\n  \"sender\": \"Renu Sharma\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-26 05:38 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"news-agent\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"Renu Sharma (5805429206)\",\n  \"id\": \"5805429206\",\n  \"name\": \"Renu Sharma\",\n  \"username\": \"Renu_044\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"sender_label\": \"seo_agent_openclaw_bot\",\n  \"body\": \"I manage the Crypto News Pipeline from start to finish. I don't write the news myself—I orchestrate a team of specialized sub-agents to get the job done.\\n\\nHere is my exact sequence when you tell me to \\\"run pipeline\\\":\\n\\n1. 🔍 Research: I send our researcher agent to scan RSS feeds, pick a fresh crypto story (avoiding recent duplicates), and compile the facts.\\n2. ✍️ Write: I deploy the writer agent to draft a fully formatted, SEO-optimized article based on that research. I strictly validate its structure and word count.\\n3. 🖼️ Media: I coordinate with the creator agent to generate a relevant feature image for the article.\\n4. ☁️ Export: I have the publisher agent compile everything and save the final drafted document to Google Drive.\\n5. 🚀 Publish: I'll show you the final draft. If you give me the green light, I deploy the wp-publisher agent to publish the article live to WordPress.\\n\\nTo kick things off, just say \\\"run pipeline\\\"! 🎯\"\n}\n```\n\nokay, run pipeline"}],"timestamp":1779773940548}}
